            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delish! I LOVE portobello mushrooms so this was right up my alley. I used baby portobellos vs. slicing a mushroom cap and sauteed them with a bit of minced garlic. I also subbed egg beaters for the egg whites and left out the water. I upped the pesta just a bit and added some shredded romano cheese along with the low-fat mozzarella. This was so good, especially when paired with some whole grain toast."
          },
