              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gf4me"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved this! I used havarti cheese instead and also lacked mushrooms, so I put in about 1/4 cup of chopped red bell peppers with the onions. I love that it's healthy and tasty and could be appropriate for breakfast or dinner and I could see this going into a breakfast burrito or taco even. Well done!",
